The water film (FluidBuddha, General site)

All pictures painted in code: film/water/engine/impasto.js and plate.js, adapted from the impasto
style of Lemo-Opuscar by Lemomo (LemoLab), https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT License
(film/water/engine/LICENSE). The style's guides (CC BY-NC 4.0) were followed under the library's
additional permission for films made with it; no part of them is copied into this repository.
No generated images, no photographs, no footage.

Typeface of the name: Roblox, the Buddha Cognitive Lab design system's logotype face (brand/fonts).
Colours: the design system's ink #0a0908, paper #f6f2ea / #fffdf9 and gold #edab48 family.
Sound: none (the film is scrubbed by scroll on the website).
